   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "グレイストーンは 本当に\r無口だった",
   "en": "Greystone really was a man of few words.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0fe2e",
