   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0fe31",
   "off": 65073,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "だが たよりになるやつだと\rいうことは 一緒に戦った\r俺にはすぐわかった",
   "en": "But having fought beside him, I knew right away he was someone I could count on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0fe7b",
