   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0fe7e",
   "off": 65150,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "リスプは 相変らず一人で\r何か 悩んでいるようだ",
   "en": "Risp, as ever, seemed to be brooding over something on her own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0feb1",
   "off": 65201,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0feb4",
   "off": 65204,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "トーナムへ 行く途中では\r知識聖堂の生活を いろいろ\r俺に教えてくれた",
   "en": "On the way to Tornam, she told me all sorts of things about life at the Temple of Knowledge.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0fefc",
   "off": 65276,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0feff",
   "off": 65279,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "古代の知識や技術を管理し\r研究する 静かな生活らしい",
   "en": "It sounded like a quiet life of preserving and studying ancient knowledge and technology.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0ff37",
   "off": 65335,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0ff3a",
   "off": 65338,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "王国の娘の資格を持つ者\rだけが\rいにしえの知識をもたらす…",
   "en": "Only one qualified to be the Daughter of the Kingdom can bring forth the Ancient Knowledge...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0ff78",
   "off": 65400,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0ff7b",
   "off": 65403,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そう繰り返していたが…",
   "en": "She kept repeating that, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT33:0ff97",
   "off": 65431,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
